(footprint "XIAO_nRF52840_SMD" (version 20221018) (generator pcbnew)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Seeed XIAO nRF52840 soldered flat by its castellated pads. Pads trimmed to 9.3 mm from centre so it fits the 19.8 mm neck. Plated holes 19/20 reach the underside BAT pads (solder from below); 15-18 reach the SWD pads. BAT and SWD hole positions checked 2026-11-10 against Seeed's XIAO nRF52840 v1.3 board layout and its official footprint (Seeed-Studio/OPL_Kicad_Library XIAO-nRF52840-SMD): BAT+/BAT- are on the D0-D6 side. The XIAO's NFC pads (unused) sit at (3.81, 9.21) and (5.715, 9.21), at the antenna end: keep vias away from them.")
